WEBVTT

00:08:58.172 --> 00:09:03.694
Now I have these learnings, these secrets
from all different multiplication tables.

00:09:04.234 --> 00:09:07.385
One of my favorites is table of 11.

00:09:08.445 --> 00:09:12.575
And I think most of us liked,
when we were in school,

00:09:12.575 --> 00:09:15.655
because that is
the easiest one to multiply.

00:09:23.435 --> 00:09:27.243
What I love about this
is the perfect symmetry in it.

00:09:27.713 --> 00:09:30.544
The one and one, the two and two.